msgid "Submission Desire"
msgstr ""

#. max 1999 bytes
msgctxt "1"
msgid "Rin Tohsaka's third SG.\n\nI don't dare comment.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n……but, it seems I have no choice. \nDear readers, this must be an SG of great interest to you.\n\nSubmission Desire is just as it reads,\nthe desire to be dominated by someone else. \nThe thing to watch out for is that\n\"submission\" doesn't mean \"a puppet lacking free will.\"\n\nTo serve something. To be owned by something.\nTo be useful for something. To be bound by something.\n\nThese desires are manifestations of a powerful ego.\nIt's precisely because they know their own worth\nthat they want to be used in a meaningful way.\n\nThough Submission Desire may vary in scale,\nit's something that exists in everyone's hearts.\nEvery human being want to be of use to someone.\n\n……though strictly speaking, \n\"I want to follow the people I respect\" and\n\"I want to submit to those lesser than me\"\nare very different things.\n\nAs something not manifest in the usual Rin Tohsaka,\nit could be called yearning, or a subconscious taboo.\nEssentially, even the Queen of the Moon wants to\nbe pampered sometimes.\n"
msgstr ""

